<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Extra Legs</ansi> mutation

Your lower body has developed additional limbs, giving you a
centaur-like stance. The added stability and power come at the cost
of your appearance — you are a disturbing sight that draws unwanted
aggression.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately increased movement speed — your extra limbs carry you
  across ground with surprising swiftness
  Slightly increased combat damage from the added stability and
  driving force of extra legs

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Greatly reduced charisma — the insectoid gait disturbs onlookers
  Draws significantly more hostile attention from enemies

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
